{"seq":6,"slug":"astrobiology","title":"天体生物学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 天体生物学（Astrobiology）\n\n## 概述\n\n天体生物学是研究宇宙中生命的起源、演化、分布和未来的跨学科科学。它融合了天文学、生物学、化学、地质学、行星科学和物理学等多个领域，致力于回答人类最古老的问题之一：我们在宇宙中是否孤独？\n\n## 核心问题\n\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((天体生物学核心问题))\n    生命起源\n      前生物化学如何产生生命？\n      RNA世界是否存在？\n      极端环境中的生命边界在哪里？\n    宜居性\n      宜居带的定义与范围\n      水在生命中的角色\n      行星保护的伦理与实践\n    生命探测\n      大气生物标志物\n      地表与地下生命迹象\n      技术信号搜索\n    星际通信\n      德雷克方程的参数估计\n      费米悖论的解释\n      SETI搜索策略\n```\n\n## 章节导航\n\n| 章节   | 主题           | 核心内容                                 |\n| ------ | -------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 第一章 | 生命起源       | 前生物化学、RNA世界假说、极端微生物学    |\n| 第二章 | 宜居性条件     | 宜居带概念、水与宜居性、行星保护         |\n| 第三章 | 生命标志物探测 | 大气生物标志物、地表/地下迹象、技术信号  |\n| 第四章 | SETI与星际通信 | 德雷克方程、费米悖论、搜索策略、星际通信 |\n\n## 学科定位\n\n天体生物学作为一门年轻的综合学科，诞生于20世纪末NASA天体生物学研究所的成立。它不仅是一门自然科学，更深刻触及哲学、伦理学和人类文明的未来走向。从米勒-尤里实验到詹姆斯·韦伯空间望远镜对系外行星大气的光谱分析，天体生物学正从理论推测走向实证研究的新纪元。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"origin-of-life","title":"生命起源（Origin of Life）","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prebiotic-chemistry","title":"前生物化学（Prebiotic Chemistry）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life/prebiotic-chemistry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rna-world-hypothesis","title":"RNA世界假说（RNA World Hypothesis）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life/rna-world-hypothesis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"extremophile-biology","title":"极端微生物学（Extremophile Biology）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life/extremophile-biology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"habitability-conditions","title":"宜居性条件（Habitability Conditions）","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"habitable-zone-concept","title":"宜居带概念（Habitable Zone Concept）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions/habitable-zone-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"water-habitability","title":"水与宜居性（Water and Habitability）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions/water-habitability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"planetary-protection","title":"行星保护（Planetary Protection）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/habitability-conditions/planetary-protection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"biosignature-detection","title":"生命标志物探测（Biosignature Detection）","docCount":3,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atmospheric-biosignatures","title":"大气生物标志物（Atmospheric Biosignatures）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection/atmospheric-biosignatures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"surface-subsurface-signs","title":"地表与地下生命迹象（Surface and Subsurface Signs of Life）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection/surface-subsurface-signs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technosignatures","title":"技术信号（Technosignatures）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/biosignature-detection/technosignatures"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"seti-communication","title":"SETI与星际通信（SETI and Interstellar Communication）","docCount":2,"url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/seti-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drake-equation-fermi","title":"德雷克方程与费米悖论（Drake Equation and Fermi Paradox）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/seti-communication/drake-equation-fermi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seti-search-strategies","title":"SETI搜索策略（SETI Search Strategies）","url":"/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/seti-communication/seti-search-strategies"}]}]}